      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KARINYA ROCKY (10) is a lightly-raced but progressive colt who was last seen when he scored by a neck over 1660m at Parkes in March. Likely to have developed further with maturity and has been readied with a couple of trials. PORCUPINE CREEK NZ (5) continued his consistent form when he drew on the back row and finished third last start at this circuit and distance. Came from a similar draw to this and raced parked when scoring at Dubbo prior. Contender. KARINYA SOPHIE (9) hasn't been too far away of late and has won a trial since her last appearance. Draws for a trail so can be competitive. TALK TO LEXY (7) draws wide but could be ready to work through the grades having broken through with a last-start win by 8 metres at Parkes.",
